ok   dns.parseip6 reads ::1
ok     (as fifteen zero bytes and a one)
ok   net.connect6 to a listening [::1]:port succeeds
ok   net.accept on the IPv6 listener takes it
ok   send on the client side
ok     and the server reads the same 13 bytes
ok   net.connect6 to a closed IPv6 port fails
ok     with ECONNREFUSED
ok   an IPv4-only listener does not answer on ::1
